      <p><strong>Registered feature storage:</strong> <?=$schemaSummary['current']?> current · <?=$schemaSummary['needs_update']?> requiring update or recovery · <?=$schemaSummary['optional']?> optional and not prepared · <?=$schemaSummary['blocking']?> unsupported.</p>
